  "environment": "Windows 10, native menus without Nilesoft Shell, fictional localized files and isolated /test preferences. Temporary 1600x1200 display mode. Other application windows are minimized during capture and restored afterward.",
  "storyboard": "Each animation starts with the cursor centered in the folder window. The menu animation opens the original menu for 2 seconds, dismisses it by clicking empty folder background, follows the complete visible toolbar-menu > FileSpacer Settings > Display > Customize title bar menu path, drags Restore locked layout into the menu and Reopen closed window out, accepts both dialogs, and leaves the final menu visible for 2 seconds. All recorded pointer transitions are interpolated and no cuts are made.",
